00:47:53,980 --> 00:47:56,140
We're simply inviting you to respond.

1032
00:47:56,140 --> 00:47:58,100
We've preached the word of God this morning

1033
00:47:58,100 --> 00:48:00,980
and now the opportunity is for you as a hearer

1034
00:48:00,980 --> 00:48:04,160
to respond to what you've heard from God's word.

1035
00:48:04,160 --> 00:48:07,500
Maybe you're here this morning and you're not sure of heaven.

1036
00:48:07,500 --> 00:48:09,460
You would say, preacher, there's never been

1037
00:48:09,820 --> 00:48:12,380
that personal decision on that particular day,

1038
00:48:12,380 --> 00:48:14,220
but I need to get that settled.

1039
00:48:14,220 --> 00:48:16,660
I don't know for sure that I'm going to go to heaven

1040
00:48:16,660 --> 00:48:18,920
when I die, but I wanna know.

1041
00:48:18,920 --> 00:48:21,260
If you'd come when the piano starts playing,

1042
00:48:21,260 --> 00:48:22,940
Mark is here, he'll take a Bible and show you,

1043
00:48:22,940 --> 00:48:25,700
I can know for sure that heaven is your home.

1044
00:48:25,700 --> 00:48:27,500
If there's a lady that comes, we'll have a lady meet

1045
00:48:27,500 --> 00:48:28,900
with you and tell you, I can know for sure

1046
00:48:28,900 --> 00:48:30,720
that heaven is your home.

1047
00:48:30,720 --> 00:48:33,480
We would not want one single person to leave here

1048
00:48:33,480 --> 00:48:35,120
this morning without knowing for sure

1049
00:48:35,120 --> 00:48:36,660
that heaven is their home.

1050
00:48:37,620 --> 00:48:41,380
Christian, maybe God's put somebody on your heart

1051
00:48:41,380 --> 00:48:43,660
that you need to share the gospel with.

1052
00:48:43,660 --> 00:48:46,460
Maybe it's a relative, maybe it's a co-worker,

1053
00:48:46,460 --> 00:48:47,580
maybe it's a neighbor.

1054
00:48:48,620 --> 00:48:50,460
Maybe you need to come and pray and ask the Lord

1055
00:48:50,460 --> 00:48:53,220
to give you that boldness and that burden

1056
00:48:53,220 --> 00:48:55,540
to take the gospel of the Lord Jesus Christ

1057
00:48:55,540 --> 00:48:57,180
to that individual.

1058
00:48:57,180 --> 00:48:59,540
As Kimberly plays, the altar is open.

1059
00:49:02,620 --> 00:49:05,420
Make haste, as Jesus said to Zacchaeus,

